{%- comment -%} The Funeral for Dead Probiotics, Black Friday 2026 (Velo-Marketing, 13 Nov 2026). Landing + RSVP. {%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  .vbf{background:#060806;color:#f3f1ea;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;margin:0;padding:0 0 72px}
  .vbf *{box-sizing:border-box}
  .vbf__hero{position:relative;min-height:78vh;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center;text-align:center;background:#060806 url('{{ "vb-funeral-hero.jpg" | asset_url }}') center 62%/cover no-repeat}
  .vbf__hero:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(6,8,6,.92) 0%,rgba(6,8,6,.35) 38%,rgba(6,8,6,.2) 60%,rgba(6,8,6,.96) 100%)}
  .vbf__in{position:relative;max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 22px}
  .vbf__kick{font:800 13px/1 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.32em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8cff5a;margin:0 0 18px}
  .vbf h1{font:400 clamp(38px,7vw,76px)/1.02 Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 18px;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.01em}
  .vbf h1 em{font-style:italic;color:#8cff5a}
  .vbf__when{font:700 15px/1.5 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d8d6cc;margin:0 0 26px}
  .vbf__count{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;margin:0 0 30px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .vbf__count div{min-width:78px;padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid rgba(140,255,90,.45);border-radius:6px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.55)}
  .vbf__count b{display:block;font:700 30px/1 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#fff}
  .vbf__count span{font:700 10px/1 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8cff5a}
  .vbf__form{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.4fr auto;gap:10px;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto}
  .vbf__form input{width:100%;padding:16px 14px;border:1px solid #6b6f66;border-radius:6px;background:#0d100d;color:#fff;font:400 16px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}
  .vbf__form input:focus{outline:2px solid #8cff5a;border-color:#8cff5a}
  .vbf__btn{padding:16px 26px;border:0;border-radius:6px;background:#8cff5a;color:#060806;font:800 15px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer}
  .vbf__btn:hover{background:#fff}
  .vbf__fine{font:400 12.5px/1.5 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#9a9d93;margin:14px auto 0;max-width:620px}
  .vbf__ok{border:1px solid #8cff5a;border-radius:8px;padding:22px;max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;background:rgba(0,0,0,.6)}
  .vbf__ok strong{display:block;font:400 28px/1.2 Georgia,serif;color:#fff;margin-bottom:8px}
  .vbf__err{color:#ffb4a8;font:700 14px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0 0 12px}
  .vbf__sec{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:64px 22px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:44px;align-items:center}
  .vbf__sec img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;border-radius:4px;box-shadow:0 18px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.6)}
  .vbf h2{font:400 clamp(28px,4vw,42px)/1.1 Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 16px;color:#fff}
  .vbf p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:#d8d6cc;margin:0 0 14px}
  .vbf a{color:#8cff5a}
  .vbf__order{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:64px 22px 0;text-align:center}
  .vbf__order ol{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:26px 0 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px;text-align:left}
  .vbf__order li{border-top:2px solid #8cff5a;padding:14px 4px 0}
  .vbf__order li b{display:block;font:800 11px/1.3 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8cff5a;margin-bottom:6px}
  .vbf__order li span{display:block;font:400 21px/1.2 Georgia,serif;color:#fff;margin-bottom:6px}
  .vbf__order li small{font:400 14px/1.5 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#b9bbb1}
  @media (max-width:760px){.vbf__form{grid-template-columns:1fr}.vbf__sec{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px;padding-top:44px}.vbf__order ol{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.vbf__hero{min-height:88vh}.vbf__count div{min-width:66px}}
</style>
<div class="vbf">
  <section class="vbf__hero">
    <div class="vbf__in">
      <p class="vbf__kick">You are invited to</p>
      <h1>A funeral for the probiotics that <em>died in your stomach.</em></h1>
      <p class="vbf__when">Friday 20 November 2026 &nbsp;·&nbsp; 19:00 SAST &nbsp;·&nbsp; Right here</p>
      <div class="vbf__count" data-vbf-count="2026-11-20T19:00:00+02:00" aria-label="Time until the funeral">
        <div><b data-d>--</b><span>Days</span></div><div><b data-h>--</b><span>Hours</span></div><div><b data-m>--</b><span>Minutes</span></div><div><b data-s>--</b><span>Seconds</span></div>
      </div>
      <div id="rsvp">
      {%- form 'customer', id: 'vbf-rsvp' -%}
        {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
          <div class="vbf__ok"><strong>Your seat is saved.</strong>The order of service is on its way to your inbox. Wear black. Bring a friend who still thinks 50 billion means 50 billion.</div>
        {%- else -%}
          {%- if form.errors -%}<p class="vbf__err">{{ form.errors | default_errors }}</p>{%- endif -%}
          <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="newsletter,funeral-rsvp">
          <div class="vbf__form">
            <input type="text" name="contact[first_name]" placeholder="First name" autocomplete="given-name" aria-label="First name">
            <input type="email" name="contact[email]" placeholder="Email address" autocomplete="email" aria-label="Email address" required>
            <button class="vbf__btn" type="submit">RSVP</button>
          </div>
          <p class="vbf__fine">Mourners who RSVP get the order of service, a front-row seat on the night, and the first reading of the will on Wednesday 25 November, 48 hours before anyone else. By RSVPing you agree to receive these emails from Velobiotics. Unsubscribe any time.</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endform -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="vbf__sec">
    <img src="{{ 'vb-funeral-notice.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Death notice from The Daily Gut: Probiotics, billions of. Passed away suddenly in stomach acid." width="900" height="900" loading="lazy">
    <div>
      <h2>They were swallowed with such hope.</h2>
      <p>Your stomach holds acid at around pH 2. Its job is to destroy the bacteria that arrive with your food, and it is very good at its job.</p>
      <p>Published laboratory studies on unprotected bifidobacteria report losses of 99.9% or more of live cells within two to three hours in stomach-strength acid. The billions on a label mean little if they are no longer alive where they are needed.</p>
      <p>So this Friday we are giving them the send-off they deserve. <a href="/pages/probiotics-tolerance-to-gastric-acid">Read the science</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="vbf__order">
    <p class="vbf__kick">Order of service</p>
    <h2>Four acts. One week. Wear black.</h2>
    <ol>
      <li><b>Mon 16 to Thu 19 Nov</b><span>The Death Notice</span><small>The news breaks. Condolences are welcome.</small></li>
      <li><b>Fri 20 Nov, 19:00</b><span>The Funeral</span><small>The film premieres on this page.</small></li>
      <li><b>Wed 25 Nov, 06:00</b><span>The Will</span><small>The departed left something. Mourners who RSVP'd hear it first.</small></li>
      <li><b>Fri 27 Nov</b><span>The After-Tears</span><small>Not everyone died. The survivors are going out.</small></li>
    </ol>
    <p style="margin-top:40px"><a class="vbf__btn" style="display:inline-block;text-decoration:none" href="#rsvp">RSVP to the funeral</a></p>
  </section>
</div>
<script>
(function(){var el=document.querySelector('[data-vbf-count]');if(!el)return;var t=new Date(el.getAttribute('data-vbf-count')).getTime();
function p(n){return (n<10?'0':'')+n}
function tick(){var s=Math.max(0,Math.floor((t-Date.now())/1000));el.querySelector('[data-d]').textContent=p(Math.floor(s/86400));el.querySelector('[data-h]').textContent=p(Math.floor(s%86400/3600));el.querySelector('[data-m]').textContent=p(Math.floor(s%3600/60));el.querySelector('[data-s]').textContent=p(s%60)}
tick();setInterval(tick,1000)})();
</script>
{% schema %}
{ "name": "VB Funeral landing", "settings": [], "presets": [{ "name": "VB Funeral landing" }] }
{% endschema %}
